15
00:00:55.315 --> 00:00:58.075
"What?" Ally asked eagerly.

16
00:00:58.076 --> 00:01:02.182
"Even the noblest Astralians don't accomplish all of their missions.

17
00:01:02.183 --> 00:01:07.281
Sometimes all you can do is try your best and accept when you fail."

18
00:01:07.282 --> 00:01:12.166
Ally groaned. "That's not helpful either.

19
00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:18.073
Can you at least research what causes Astralians to lose their powers?"

20
00:01:18.074 --> 00:01:22.557
Alpha buzzed. "I found something that might apply.

21
00:01:22.558 --> 00:01:28.968
